WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.737
Many analytics projects begin with a CSV file.

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:12.437
In this browser example, the CSV content is stored as text so the lesson can run without uploading a file.

00:00:12.437 --> 00:00:19.808
StringIO makes that text behave like a file, and Pandas read_csv converts it into a DataFrame.

00:00:20.474 --> 00:00:27.201
The table has two input columns—hours and practice—and one outcome column called passed.

00:00:27.201 --> 00:00:33.263
In a real project, the same read_csv call could point to an actual file path.
